message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository and acknowledge the Ruggeri et al. framework listed in references."
title: "D-HySBM: Hypergraph Message Passing"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ye"
    given-names: "Dawei"
abstract: "Order-resolved hypergraph stochastic block model inference, degree-corrected extensions, synthetic sampling, and Rust-accelerated belief propagation. The main architecture builds on the framework of Ruggeri, Lonardi, and De Bacco (2024)."
keywords:
  - hypergraphs
  - community detection
  - belief propagation
  - stochastic block models
